> -+file =3D file is a file
> -+dir  =3D file is a empty directory
> -+child=3D file is a non-empty directory
> -+wh   =3D file is a directory containing only whiteouts; this makes it l=
ogically
> -+		empty
> -+
> -+                      none    file    dir     child   wh
> -+file                  o       o       E       E       E
> -+dir                   o       E       o       E       o
> -+child                 X       E       X       E       X
> -+wh                    o       E       o       E       o
